  "notes": "Mozart K.331/iii, opening period without repeats: A (bars 1-8, half cadence on E), B (bars 9-16, C major), A' (bars 17-24, authentic cadence on A) = 24 bars of 2/4. Pickup B4-A4-G#4-A4 (1 beat); final bar shortened to one beat. Old repo went wrong from bar 3 on and used quarters where Mozart has eighth plus eighth rest. Grace notes before bars 5-7 and the trill in bar 23 are left out; the written-out trill ending (B4 dotted eighth, A4-B4 32nds) is kept. LH added (tags lack two-hands): Mozart's A3 + C4/E4 eighths, the B-section octave/arpeggio bass, and the A' cadence. Clean at advanced level; D#5 is a chromatic neighbour. Suggest adding a two-hands tag."
}
